#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:2 0f2f88334d474438abcaea436309360e
msgid "_`CMakeLists Configuration`"
msgstr "CMakeLists 配置"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:5 ceba46b86fcf4061832adae5fc47c058
msgid "_`Overview`"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:7 8030be2063544f3cb1073430fe6c4682
msgid ""
"The CMakeLists.txt file is the core build configuration file for the fcpp"
" project, responsible for project building, dependency management, and "
"module compilation."
msgstr ""
"CMakeLists.txt 文件是 fcpp 项目的核心构建配置文件，负责项目构建、依赖管理"
"和模块编译。"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:11 6791213670d74d20a4728e2e3df4edb8
msgid "_`Key Features`"
msgstr "主要特性"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:13 45f6cead086b451c9fbf000ba0ab9de0
msgid "Project initialization and metadata parsing"
msgstr "项目初始化与元数据解析"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:14 d9f7075aa55e44fa95ce702b811c539d
msgid "Automatic source file collection and target creation"
msgstr "自动源文件收集与目标创建"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:15 b491c35c9d8b42abada16c8f23ea4b7c
msgid "Dependency management and linking"
msgstr "依赖管理与链接"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:16 184ed263fae14d13b5f8ff4de328970d
msgid "C++ module support configuration"
msgstr "C++ 模块支持配置"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:17 625d47eeb177437ba9cd98c286bd2e47
msgid "Installation rule definition"
msgstr "安装规则定义"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:20 2e53ae7d99e24dbba13db1de83640ff2
msgid "_`Main Configurations`"
msgstr "主要配置项"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:22 c60ee7edd0fa42a4950c9727b40d9eac
msgid ""
"The CMake configuration automatically reads project information from "
"metadata.json, collects source files from include and src directories, "
"creates separate static libraries for C and C++ components, and "
"configures module support for C++23 and above."
msgstr ""
"CMake 配置会自动从 metadata.json 读取项目信息，从 include 和 src 目录收集"
"源文件，为 C 和 C++ 组件分别创建静态库，并配置 C++23 及以上版本的模块支持。"

#: ../../source/components/cmake.rst:26 71eee7e9c74e40b8a509648b9dbdf075
msgid ""
"Platform-specific module compilation is handled with appropriate settings"
" for MSVC (.ixx files) and GCC/Clang (.cppm files). The configuration "
"also includes installation rules for libraries and headers."
msgstr ""
"平台特定的模块编译通过针对 MSVC (.ixx 文件) 和 GCC/Clang (.cppm 文件) 的适"
"当设置进行处理。该配置还包含库和头文件的安装规则。"